  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-Stakeholder Initiative for Peace and Stability (MIPS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To identify, prevent and mitigate incidents of political, religious, ethnic/social tensions/violence, the project will support multi-stakeholder and multi-faith platform in few targeted areas. It will analyse trends, drivers and determinants of conflict/violence and strengthen community mediation to promote peace and harmony. The project will be implemented in partnership with think tank/researchers and peace volunteers in targeted districts, including Chittagong Hill Tracts.</narrative>
  </description>
